OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer headbutted and left
OL,4,Awith 'significant facial injury'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 44-year-old man was arrested and
OL,7,Flater charged with possession of an
OL,8,Foffensive weapon, threats to kill and
OL,9,Fpossession of a Class A controlled
OL,10,Fdrug, as well as assault on police.
